      },
      "content": "When transporting  the  machine,  there  is  a  risk  of  mixing  with  sand  or  dust.  Therefore secure the saddle or cross slide before cleaning",
      "section_id": "sec_6",
      "parent_section_id": null,
      "section_level": 1,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_6",
          "title": "6. Cleaning"
        }
      ],
      "page": 70,
      "chunk_hint": "section_start",
      "semantic_role": "overview",
      "source": "pdf_text"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0399",
      "reading_order": 520,
      "section": "6. Cleaning",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 99.29964600000002,
        "t": 713.654864,
        "r": 504.38419799999855,
        "b": 704.7831449281769
      },
      "content": "Because each part of this machine has tightened at factory, loosen and then clean it.",
      "section_id": "sec_6",
      "parent_section_id": null,
      "section_level": 1,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_6",
          "title": "6. Cleaning"
        }
      ],
      "page": 70,
      "chunk_hint": "continue",
      "semantic_role": "description",
      "source": "pdf_text"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0400",
      "reading_order": 521,
      "section": "6. Cleaning",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 99.29964600000002,
        "t": 696.674972,
        "r": 527.333004000001,
        "b": 670.823360928177
      },
      "content": "When cleaning the machine, wipe out the anticorrosive paint using soft cotten clothes wet with kerosene or benzene.",
      "section_id": "sec_6",
      "parent_section_id": null,
      "section_level": 1,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_6",
          "title": "6. Cleaning"
        }
      ],
      "page": 70,
      "chunk_hint": "continue",
      "semantic_role": "description",
      "source": "pdf_text"
    },
    {
